    "1. Install libimobiledevice by following the instructions at %@.\n2. Connect this device to your computer using USB, then tap Trust when prompted.\n3. In Terminal, run iproxy %d:%d and leave it running.\n4. In Firefox on your computer, open about:debugging and select Setup.\n5. Under Network Location, add localhost:%d, then select Connect." : {
      "comment" : "Remote debugging setup instructions; port placeholders",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Install libimobiledevice by following the instructions at %1$@.\n2. Connect this device to your computer using USB, then tap Trust when prompted.\n3. In Terminal, run iproxy %2$d:%3$d and leave it running.\n4. In Firefox on your computer, open about:debugging and select Setup.\n5. Under Network Location, add localhost:%4$d, then select Connect."
          }
        }
      }
    },
